  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 21.3333px; orphans: auto; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">(20 fotos) Aquest diumenge,&nbsp;6 de setembre, s&#39;ha produ&iuml;t al Sal&oacute; de Plens de l&#39;Ajuntament de Suera el nomenament oficial&nbsp;com a reina de les festes 2015 d&#39;Alba Lengua Garcia (de blanc), que substituir&agrave; en el c&agrave;rrec a Claudia Ortells Sorribes (amb vestit estampat).</span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nomenamentrinafestessuera15albalenguagarcia/p1150982.jpg\" alt=\"p1150982\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nomenamentrinafestessuera15albalenguagarcia/p1150984.jpg\" alt=\"p1150984\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nomenamentrinafestessuera15albalenguagarcia/p1150986.jpg\" alt=\"p1150986\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nomenamentrinafestessuera15albalenguagarcia/p1150987.jpg\" alt=\"p1150987\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nomenamentrinafestessuera15albalenguagarcia/p1150988.jpg\" alt=\"p1150988\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nomenamentrinafestessuera15albalenguagarcia/p1150991.jpg\" alt=\"p1150991\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nomenamentrinafest